    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amashiesio",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhaana weefwe Fibi ngwoyo; nomudikonesi weikanisa eyili eKengerea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumwinjisie muMwami, shinga olwa kakhoyeele abatakatifu; khandi mbu mumukhoonye mwikhuwa liosi elia anyala okhwenya mwinywe; okhuba omwene yabeelenje omuhabini wabandu abanji, kata khwisie omwene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Pirisika nende Akula, abakholi abashianje muKristo Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abalekhuula obulamu bwabwe khulwa obulamu bwanje; ne shindi nisie sienyene oubakhupila orio ta, habula nende tsikanisa tsiosi tsiAbamahanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi mushiesilie ikanisa eyili munzu yabwe. Mushiesilie Epaineto, omuheelwa wanje; ne niye omurongole waAsia khuKristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Mariamu, owamunyakhanila muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Anderoniko naYunia, abaluyia banje khandi ababohe abashianje, abali abeifuma mubarume, khandi abaranjilila isie muKristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushuesilie Ambiliato, omuheelwa wanje muMwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Urubano, omukholi owashieefwe muKristo, nende Sitakisi, omuheelwa wanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Apele, owateemwa nafuchiililwa muKristo. Mubashiesie abomunzu yaArisitobulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Herodioni omuluyia wanje. Mubashiesie abomunzu yaNarikiso, abali muMwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Turifena nende Turifosa, abanyakhana muMwami. Mushiesilie Peresisi omuheelwa, ounyakhana muno muMwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Rufusu, omumanyikhu muMwami, nende nyina, okhuba nimama siesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Asingirito, naFulegoni, naHereme, naPataroba, naHerema, nende abaana beefwe bosi aba bali halala ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesilie Filologo, na Yulia, Nerea nende omukhaana wabwe, naOlimba, nende abatakatifu bosi aba bali halala ninabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mushiesanie nende okhutsunzuunana okhutakatifu. Tsikanisa tsiaKristo tsiosi tsimushiesia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano emusaaya, baana beefwe, muhenje abeenabo abachilanga obukabukhani nende ebiisichirasio nibibaho, nibafukula ameechesio ako aka mweeka, mbu mwiyahule khubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila abali bario shibali abasumba bOmwami weefwe Kristo ta, habula tsinda tsiabwe abeene; ne khulwa okhuboola khwabwe okhubuulu, okhurelele, bakaatia emioyo chiabeshiilongoole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba obuhulili bweenywe bufumanga mubandu bosi. Niko akachila nimwikhoyela muno ne enzenya mbu mubeetsenje abachesi khukaii amalayi, habula abasilu khukali amabii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Nyasaye womulembe alasasaka Setani hasi wamakulu keenywe nonoho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukoosia bwOmwami weefwe Yesu Kristo bubeetsenie nineenywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timotseyo, omukholi owashianje, amushiesia; nende Lukio naYasoni naSosipatero, abaluyia banje, bosi bario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isie Teretio, omuhandiichi weibarwa yino, emushiesia muMwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayo, omwinjisia wanje khandi oweikanisa yosi, amushiesia. Erasito, omubiishi welitookho lino, amushiesia, nende Kwarito, omwana weefwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukoosia bwOmwami weefwe Yesu Kristo bubeetsenje nineenywe mwesi. Amina.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akahelelesia, akobwitsoomii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano aheebwe oluyali omwenoyo ounyala okhumuralisia, shinga injiili yanje nende akeelwatsungwa khuYesu Kristo olwa kaboola; khandi namalala nobufwimbuli bwelibiso eliabiswa mubise biobumeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bulaano libakaalwe habulafu; ne khulwa lilako liaNyasaye owobumeli, limanyishilanga mumahanga kosi khulwa amahandiiko kabanabii, mbu mana bahulilenje khulwa okhusuubila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye omwene obuchesi yenyene aheebwe oluyali obushia nobushia khulwa Yesu Kristo. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
